{60}{When an islander dies, my role is to guide the soul beyond death. Long ago, our ancestors discovered the ritual of Spirit Separation. Only by this means can souls leave this world in peace.}{When an islander dies, my role is to guide the soul beyond death. Long ago, our ancestors discovered the ritual of Spirit Separation. Only by this means can souls leave this world in peace.}{}{}{}{}
