{65}{Only you do ritual?}{}{-4}{lf1 1, lf2 1, lf4 0}{120}{lf4 1}

{90}{The body of the deceased must be wrapped in a silken cocoon, like the one a caterpillar weaves before becoming a butterfly. Then an incantation is spoken, separating the soul from the body.}{The body of the deceased must be wrapped in a silken cocoon, like the one a caterpillar weaves before becoming a butterfly. Then an incantation is spoken, separating the soul from the body.}{}{}{}{}
