{150}{The Death Lanterns that try to enter the tomb after nightfall are seeking the source that draws them... the source of evil... I have prepared the ritual of Spirit Separation inside the tomb many times. More and more often, I have had to fight monstrous beings that appeared from nowhere... I fear that some greater power summoned them, but I cannot say what it is...}{The Death Lanterns that try to enter the tomb after nightfall are seeking the source that draws them... the source of evil... I have prepared the ritual of Spirit Separation inside the tomb many times. More and more often, I have had to fight monstrous beings that appeared from nowhere... I fear that some greater power summoned them, but I cannot say what it is...}{}{}{}{}
{151}{I want to enter the tomb and discover what is drawing the Death Lanterns.}{}{5}{lf5 1, lf6 0}{180}{lf6 1}
