{180}{It is very dangerous to venture into the tomb without knowing it. But if you can discover what lurks there and draws the Death Lanterns to our village, it would greatly aid me in fighting this evil... I accept your offer and hope to see you return alive someday... Here, take 100 coins. Visit the herbalist and buy healing potions. You will sorely need them...}{It is very dangerous to venture into the tomb without knowing it. But if you can discover what lurks there and draws the Death Lanterns to our village, it would greatly aid me in fighting this evil... I accept your offer and hope to see you return alive someday... Here, take 100 coins. Visit the herbalist and buy healing potions. You will sorely need them...}{}{}{}{qu1275 2}
